{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "port-security",
  "description": "IOS and NX-OS standalone access-port security with three distinct source MACs. Requires authorized forwarding before interpreting blocked third-host traffic. The Nexus path uses a transit target on a second port, and all links exist before boot. Includes native image-specific diagnostics and bounded convergence waits.",
  "nodes": [
